00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:52.150
We had him take a leave from the conference with the Gods and Demons.

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:53.770
Oh, long time no see.

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.400
You're charming as usual.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:56.940
You don't change either.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:02.070
Since I'm back as a teacher, I must deliver love to my students.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:03.950
You need not do that.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.870
You've been fired from your position as teacher.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:06.870
Eh?

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:08.410
It's an order from the principal.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.540
It's reasonable considering that you were AWOL for 20 years.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:14.420
I'm fired?!

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:19.970
Geez, you could have broken the seal the students put on you anytime.

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.680
But...

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:26.260
It was my first time enjoying something as amazing as that.

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:34.480
A 20-year long unattended play!

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:46.450
A rose's life is pure and noble.
Bara no inochi wa kiyoku kedakaku.

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:53.500
A splendid fate, like burning in the flame,
Hito moeru you na karei na shukumei.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:20:00.920
Deep red flower in the heart,
Kegasareru koto nado nai.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:07.390
That can not be tainted,
Shinku no kokoro no hana yo.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.810
La vie I won't be bored,
La vie taikutsu nado.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:15.270
La vie I won't forgive.
La vie yurushi wa shinai.

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:18.860
Since I chose you.
Anata wo eranda kara.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:22.450
La vie en rose.
La vie en rose.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:26.030
If the love fallen upon this earth,
Chi ni ochita ai ga.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.540
Shall die out,
Shiorete shimaru nara.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.040
These flower petals.
Mizukara kono hanabira.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:36.840
I shall let fall myself.
Chirasu deshou.

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:57.810
Gone! It's g-g-gone!

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:00.730
It's nowhere to be found!

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:03.110
Where could've it gone...

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:05.320
Could it be...

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.740
Let me go...

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.740
It's lunchtime already.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:13.000
Let's hurry to school and play!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:16.920
No!

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:28.550
How did this happen...?

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:33.930
The magical potion that you were exposed to yesterday must've caused it.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.100
<b>Good thing it wasn't a monster or anything.</b>

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:39.900
It's not a problem if Takuto becomes a monster or grows tentacles.

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:43.030
<b>Taku-chan, leave it to us.</b>

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:45.370
Everyone...

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:51.200
W-Why am I dressed like this?

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:54.540
It looks great, my master.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.420
Everything looks fabulous on Takuto.

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.500
Yes, really.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.090
Oh, it's not like that...

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:06.510
You're a girl from every single angle.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:08.550
You sure are lovely.

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:11.600
Everyone's so cruel...

00:22:12.140 --> 00:22:13.970
What's the matter?

00:22:13.970 --> 00:22:17.290
The gothic-lolita look might be problematic.

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:17.730
Taku-chan, I love them all.
The gothic-lolita look might be problematic.

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:19.480
Taku-chan, I love them all.

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:36.750
But this is my own body.

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:41.330
S-S-S-S-S-S-S-S-S-Sempai!

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:43.880
A success!

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:48.470
With this I can correct the tainted world!

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.300
How will you do it?

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:52.600
This is the bishoujo transformation medicine!

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:58.100
Aburaya Atsuo, Age 54
A miracle medicine which will transform an oily, disgusting man into a teen bishoujo.

00:22:58.360 --> 00:23:00.810
Just get me back to normal, will you?!

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:03.150
Dont worry, it will soon wear...

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:09.650
On second thought, you're really cute...

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:12.620
Actually, I've been...

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:14.490
You just thought of it this second!

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:15.740
No, seriously.

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:17.830
Then I don't want to turn back!

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:20.250
Takuto!

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:24.750
No!

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:30.180
Miyabi... please... I can't take it anymore.

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:32.430
Sinclavier, I was thinking the same thing.

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:33.880
Now, give me your hands.

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:34.510
Miyabi...

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:35.510
Sinclavier...

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:40.020
We will surely escape from Eitarou today!
